@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5091
@apiKey = devkey
# The id from GET /user/list
@userId = 00000000000000000000000000000000

### Habits of a day and what they do to recovery
GET {{HostAddress}}/journal?userId={{userId}}&date=2026-10-16
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Mark a habit
POST {{HostAddress}}/journal
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "{{userId}}", "date": "2026-10-16", "tag": "Alcohol", "on": true }
